{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/944097-arab-cwod-players","id":944097,"title":"Arab cWoD players.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-04T20:23:47-07:00","id":944097,"title":"Arab cWoD players.","content":"I've been wondering if there are any arabic speaking individuals who play World of Darkness stuff. I met a few from Egypt and such, but I'm wondering if there are people who play it from a variety of other countries, would be nice to know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12188-theexplosivearrow","name":"TheExplosiveArrow","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T04:31:34-07:00","id":944238,"title":"","content":"Um, mind unpacking that a bit? Arabic speaking players is a very different category from ethnically Arab players, which is different from people that live in Arab majority countries or countries with very large ethnically Arab populations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T04:50:14-07:00","id":944242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/944097-arab-cwod-players?p=944238#post944238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Um, mind unpacking that a bit? Arabic speaking players is a very different category from ethnically Arab players, which is different from people that live in Arab majority countries or countries with very large ethnically Arab populations.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's quite self-explanatory really, people from Arabic ethnic background. I'm an Arab myself, I'm just wondering if there are any who had played any of these games that are like me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12188-theexplosivearrow","name":"TheExplosiveArrow","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T13:04:14-07:00","id":944479,"title":"","content":"It's been a while, but in college my gaming club had a few (not that we were that big, we only had a few of any given demographic besides male) Arab members. Most were Arab-American, and two were exchange students (IIRC Palestinian and a guy from an Arab family living in Turkey, but I can't remember if they immigrated to Turkey or were technical nationals from another country).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:36:46-07:00